  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/kasodi-edit">KASODI Edit</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Boston Green Wine Glass</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
            alt="Villeroy & Boch Boston green wine glass styled by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · GLASSWARE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Boston Green Wine Glass
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Villeroy & Boch
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A distinctive green wine glass from Villeroy & Boch’s Boston collection,
            defined by its faceted diamond pattern and rich colour. The short, wide
            stem sits comfortably in the hand, while the rounded rim makes it an
            elegant choice for wine and chilled drinks.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Capacity</span>
              <strong>230 ml</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Green</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Collection</span>
              <strong>Boston</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Care</span>
              <strong>Dishwasher safe</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Wine · Aperitifs · Chilled drinks</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/4ignGPh"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            We love the Boston glass for the way it combines colour with classic
            tableware. Its geometric diamond pattern catches the light beautifully,
            while the deep green tone adds character without making the table feel
            overly formal.
          </p>

          <p>
            Designed as a white wine glass, its 230 ml size also makes it a lovely
            choice for chilled drinks, aperitifs or small desserts. We especially
            like it paired with natural linen, warm ceramics and simple table
            settings where the glass can become the accent.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Made for everyday use</h2>

        <p>
          Dishwasher safe and designed for easy everyday care. For lasting clarity
          and shine, place the glass securely in the dishwasher and avoid contact
          with other glassware during the wash cycle.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Natural Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Pair it with warm ivory or oatmeal linen for a soft and understated
              table setting.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Earthy Ceramics</h3>
            <p>
              Olive, cream and hand-glazed stoneware complement the green glass
              beautifully.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Warm Metallics</h3>
            <p>
              Brass or brushed-gold cutlery adds warmth without overpowering the
              colour of the glass.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>
<section class="continue-exploring">

